        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "To pursue these aims, gender statistics play a crucial role by providing the empirical evidence necessary to inform data-driven policies, allocate resources effectively, raise public awareness, and support change. Among existing instruments, the Gender Equality Index (GEI), released annually by the European Institute for Gender Equality",
